  "content": "\n\n<h1>DarkRPG 主選單 - DarkMenu</h1>\n<p><strong>描述</strong></p>\n<p>來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包的主選單</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>特色功能</h2>\n<p>（這些特色功能將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗）&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這是來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 整合包</a> 的主選單。它最初主要用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 整合包</a>，但現在已開放給所有人使用。此模組更改了選單背景、選項背景與按鈕文字，賦予其更濃厚的 RPG 風格。並新增了受《黑暗靈魂》啟發的死亡畫面。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/673/913/main-menu-screenshot-new.png\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/617/80/2023-02-04_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/673/155/2023-06-07_04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就租用伺服器，與朋友們一起遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅 &amp; 使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享有 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
